{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 159032, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 106320, "uid": 109198, "type": 4, "title": "温泉泡法与天子推荐", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1655002790, "updated_at": 1684252001, "updated_uid": 109198, "comment_at": 1688437907, "last_at": 1688437907, "comment_count": 12, "status": 1, "summary": "温泉泡法推荐折叠颜色：注：建议提前看下《温泉经验表》以及国际服的《温泉及抓鬼解说》《【国际服】温泉计算器》等帖子。温泉币的来源主要就是百鬼，一轮百鬼（十次）的收益一般是4800温泉币，能约买17条毛巾", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1252/h_747/1069/109198/2022/5/17/38769.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 28, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 22453, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 75, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 159032, "content": "<div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container active-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">温泉泡法推荐</div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">注：建议提前看下<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/155184.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:rgba(0,182,79,0.7);font-size:13.9999px;\">《温泉经验表》</a>以及国际服的</span><a href=\"https://dc.gamekee.com/26199.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:rgba(0,182,79,0.7);font-size:0.37333rem;\">《温泉及抓鬼解说》</a><a href=\"https://dc.gamekee.com/27445.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:rgba(0,182,79,0.7);font-size:0.37333rem;\">《【国际服】温泉计算器》</a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">等</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">帖子。</span><br style=\"\"></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">温泉币的来源主要就是百鬼，</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">一轮百鬼（十次）的收益一般是4800温泉币，能约买17条毛巾；其次是泡的过程里每90分钟给最多70温泉币/天子，最多收3次，即1050温泉币/池子。理论上，20个坑一天四次共需要80条毛巾（23200温泉币），也就是至少14200温泉币（=23200-4800-1050*4）的缺口≈3轮百鬼。</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">但是，<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/157898.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:rgba(0,182,79,0.7);\">天子要毕业必须要持续泡温泉，直到百泉</a>。</span></span><span style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;\">那么，如何</span><span style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;\">在有限的资源下泡温泉？</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">温泉灵气的来源有以下三类：</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1. 基础</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">毛巾：无可替代，290温泉币一个，没有毛巾连温泉皮都用不成！</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">6小时：可以按“2000钻”立即结束</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2. （单天子）立即生效（类似充能量）</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">温泉皮：40380灵气，谁不喜欢？</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">温泉礼物：有三四五星，也有0、1、2、3爱心，分为不同级别。好像唯一3爱心的是氪金常见的三星零食，实际上温泉商店就有卖的，300温泉币一个，能增加1100左右灵气。</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">3. （整池子）结束生效（类似充能速度）</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">花之精：结束+20%经验，1000温泉币一个，一个池子使用，五个天子刚好增加100%，也就是1700灵气。</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">不管温泉皮，单</span>从温泉币的价格来算：</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">毛巾肯定是第一，但是它需要时间的，所以可以说290温泉币&lt;&lt;1700灵气；</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">3爱心零食的性价比比较平衡，300温泉币～1100灵气；按此算，花之精的价格应有3600灵气，实际上只有一半了。</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">1爱心三星礼物：大概在400灵气出头，实在着急也可以送。</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">2爱心三星礼物：大概在500灵气左右，这个和花之精的性价比接近。</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">四五星礼物：我没在商店见过。。。</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">建议：</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1. 多刷温泉币（比如之前的百鬼hottime），攒足够的毛巾，比如1120条（大概3w3体力～3.3kw金币），足够<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">20天子在</span>两周时间里一天四次。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2. 优先买零食：<div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"160\" data-height=\"247\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_160/h_247/1069/109198/2022/5/17/853450.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_160/h_247/1069/109198/2022/5/17/853450.png\" style=\"height:169.813px;width:110px;\"></div></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">3. 其次买花之精，再是2爱心礼物（</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;\">仔细看下这张表还是比较好记的）：</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"1252\" data-height=\"747\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1252/h_747/1069/109198/2022/5/17/38769.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1252/h_747/1069/109198/2022/5/17/38769.png\" style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;font-weight:700;\">盾-石头-&gt;石头饰品</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;font-weight:700;\">刀-贵-&gt;资本主义</span><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;font-weight:700;\">辅-幼-&gt;小孩玩具</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;font-weight:700;\">扰-巫婆-&gt;玄学道具</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;font-weight:700;\">奶-想吃-&gt;吃货宵夜</span></span></div></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;\">问：体力要翻牌，要挖矿，没给百鬼留一毛，怎么办？</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;\">答：赚够金币再来吧。。。<br></span></div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></div><br></div><div><br></div><div>整理下个人觉得值得优先泡温泉的天子们。<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">温泉泡起来极其消耗时间和金币，需要提早规划。</span>主要是给新入坑的萌新铺个路，少走些弯路。说得不对，还请多指教。</div><div>核心是泡那些长期不会错，而且不泡会死的那种。</div><div><br></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">1. 五色RD/RB</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">最优先的五把刀：</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1069/109198/2023/3/26/457804.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1069/109198/2023/3/26/457804.png\" style=\"width: 128px; height: 128px;\"><img data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1069/109198/2023/3/26/168624.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1069/109198/2023/3/26/168624.png\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; width: 128px; height: 128px;\"><img data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1069/109198/2023/3/26/51931.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1069/109198/2023/3/26/51931.png\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; width: 128px; height: 128px;\"><img data-width=\"256\" data-height=\"256\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_256/h_256/1069/109198/2023/3/26/328835.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_256/h_256/1069/109198/2023/3/26/328835.png\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; width: 128px; height: 128px;\"><img data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1069/109198/2023/3/26/649449.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1069/109198/2023/3/26/649449.png\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; width: 128px; height: 128px;\"></div><br></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">通用角</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/318415.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/318415.png\" style=\"height:128px;width:128px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">推荐攻略：<span style=\"\">https://destinychild.gamekee.com/95082.html</span></div></div></div>\n                               <checker-extension class=\"_1KJtL\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0px;left:0px;pointer-events:none;z-index:9999;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px;\"><div style=\"box-sizing: content-box; top: 55px; left: 5px; width: 714px; height: 303px; position: relative; pointer-events: none; overflow: hidden; border: 0px; border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;\"><div style=\"top: 0px; left: 0px; position: absolute;\"><div style=\"width: 2048px; height: 942px;\"></div></div><div class=\"xzmce_tip-button-warp\" style=\"bottom: 5px;\"><div class=\"xzmce_tip-button xzmce_count-button\"><span>L</span></div></div></div></div></checker-extension></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">2. 个人的PVP队伍</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">这个因人而异了，按照自己练度和排行榜去练了。<br></div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">（个人是选这几个泡的）</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/499664.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/499664.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/801495.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/801495.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/214460.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/214460.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/391842.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/391842.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><img data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/494644.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/494644.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;height:128px;width:128px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/319747.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/319747.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\"></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/763102.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/763102.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/109198/2023/3/26/875457.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/109198/2023/3/26/875457.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/348991.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/348991.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/666242.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/666242.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/253580.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/253580.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\"><img data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"89\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_90/h_89/1069/109198/2022/8/4/57914.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_90/h_89/1069/109198/2022/8/4/57914.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:129px;height:128px;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"159\" data-height=\"158\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_159/h_158/1069/109198/2022/8/4/670965.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_159/h_158/1069/109198/2022/8/4/670965.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:128px;height:127px;\"><br></div></div></div></div></div>\n                               <checker-extension class=\"_1KJtL\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0px;left:0px;pointer-events:none;z-index:9999;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px;\"><div style=\"box-sizing: content-box; top: 55px; left: 5px; width: 714px; height: 322px; position: relative; pointer-events: none; overflow: hidden; border: 0px; border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;\"><div style=\"top: 0px; left: 0px; position: absolute;\"><div style=\"width: 2048px; height: 942px;\"></div></div><div class=\"xzmce_tip-button-warp\" style=\"bottom: 5px;\"><div class=\"xzmce_tip-button xzmce_count-button\"><span>L</span></div></div></div></div></checker-extension></div><br><br></div></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">3. 五色WB刀</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">十五（或者十六）把刀，早晚都要泡。</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"\">推荐看WB大佬攻略：https://destinychild.gamekee.com/89833.html</span><br></div></div>\n                               <checker-extension class=\"_1KJtL\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0px;left:0px;pointer-events:none;z-index:9999;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px;\"><div style=\"box-sizing: content-box; top: 55px; left: 5px; width: 714px; height: 100px; position: relative; pointer-events: none; overflow: hidden; border: 0px; border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;\"><div style=\"top: 0px; left: 0px; position: absolute;\"><div style=\"width: 2048px; height: 942px;\"></div></div><div class=\"xzmce_tip-button-warp\" style=\"bottom: 5px;\"><div class=\"xzmce_tip-button xzmce_count-button\"><span>L</span></div></div></div></div></checker-extension></div><br><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">4. 星云WB前排</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">星云WB打人好疼，而且只能靠点火和温泉。</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">选十个通用性高的站前排挨揍，<a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv14735215\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:rgba(0,182,79,0.7);\">参考牛头鹿的攻略</a>，比如：</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/76293.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/76293.png\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/74127.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/74127.png\" style=\"\">（缝合龙鱼……比如老的<img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/595465.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/595465.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/536725.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/536725.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">）<img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/328351.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/328351.png\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/21089.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/21089.png\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/78009.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/78009.png\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/88055.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/88055.png\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/605810.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/605810.png\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/755317.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/755317.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\"></div></div></div>\n                               <checker-extension class=\"_1KJtL\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0px;left:0px;pointer-events:none;z-index:9999;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px;\"><div style=\"box-sizing: content-box; top: 55px; left: 5px; width: 714px; height: 322px; position: relative; pointer-events: none; overflow: hidden; border: 0px; border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;\"><div style=\"top: 0px; left: 0px; position: absolute;\"><div style=\"width: 2048px; height: 942px;\"></div></div><div class=\"xzmce_tip-button-warp\" style=\"bottom: 5px;\"><div class=\"xzmce_tip-button xzmce_count-button\"><span>L</span></div></div></div></div></checker-extension></div><br><br></div></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">5. 地狱地铁</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">地狱地铁，真能对得起“地狱”这两个字。<div>因为还没有完全统一的阵容，以我个人熟悉的情况来看，除了水菩萨以外<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">很多和PVP是重合的，比如格里拉，金星、VVA、金币娘、暗伞、老板娘、JOJO等。</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">剩下的必须要提到的有：</span></div><div>甜甜圈：</div><div><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/531913.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/531913.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">：现在的甜甜圈，星云和地狱地铁都堪称主力中的主力。</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">水伞奶：</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/770194.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/770194.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">：有了水伞，你们随便向前冲。<br></span></div><div>木丽莎：</div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/342412.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/342412.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">：时代的眼泪（噙住了），她的无敌和格里拉的坚韧免疫互刷，让最地狱的敌人看傻眼。<br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div class=\"div-img\">轮滑：</div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1069/109198/2022/8/4/807453.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1069/109198/2022/8/4/807453.png\" style=\"width: 128px; height: 128px;\">：和任何打S的角色一起都是最佳拍档。</div><div class=\"div-img\">水牡丹：</div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/791638.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/791638.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">：能加速能奶，不需要水伞的情况下，让她上。<br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/407434.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/407434.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">：没了日常任务，新玛斯还可以在地铁里发挥余热。</span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">虎牙妹：</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"129\" data-height=\"125\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_129/h_125/1069/109198/2022/8/4/511233.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_129/h_125/1069/109198/2022/8/4/511233.png\" style=\"\">：有人说她可以，不过我用得不多。但是皮肤那么涩，不泡不合适哈。。。</div></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br></span></div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">6. 五星乱斗</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">乱斗阵容清一色都差不多，就连站位都是一模一样。。。</span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/375105.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/375105.png\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/254860.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/254860.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\">：魅惑姐妹花。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/926629.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/926629.png\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;\">：乱斗赖皮。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/466246.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/466246.png\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/801693.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/801693.png\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/101522.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/101522.png\" style=\"\">：经常被ban，肯定是因为强。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/803767.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/803767.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\"><br></div></div><br></div><br></div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">7. 其他有<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 13.9999px;\">不错</span>通用性</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">考虑到刀在前面基本都涵盖到了，奶能用的也没几个，辅助大部分比较能抗。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">在此，列几个盾和干扰，以备不时之需。。。（谁知道ch还会整出什么幺蛾子）<br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" style=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/151842.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/151842.png\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;\">：是<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">真的</span>硬，双重乱斗表现极佳。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/217291.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/109198/2022/5/12/217291.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">：剪刀妹，肯定有她大展拳脚的一天；这一天来了，跟其他刀<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">（比如老八）</span>一起PVP，我愿称之为三刀队！@20230418<br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"89\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_90/h_89/1069/109198/2022/8/6/375883.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_90/h_89/1069/109198/2022/8/6/375883.png\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; width: 128px; height: 126px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\">：有攻略说星云很好用。（曾经的du哥推荐）</span><br></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1069/109198/2022/8/6/809020.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1069/109198/2022/8/6/809020.png\" style=\"width: 128px; height: 128px;\">：锦上添花，配合甜甜圈打打地铁星云之类的还可以；星4还在上岗。</div></div></div></div></div>\n                               <checker-extension class=\"_1KJtL\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0px;left:0px;pointer-events:none;z-index:9999;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px;\"><div style=\"box-sizing: content-box; top: 55px; left: 5px; width: 714px; height: 963px; position: relative; pointer-events: none; overflow: hidden; border: 0px; border-radius: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;\"><div style=\"top: 0px; left: 0px; position: absolute;\"><div style=\"width: 2048px; height: 942px;\"></div></div><div class=\"xzmce_tip-button-warp\" style=\"bottom: 5px;\"><div class=\"xzmce_tip-button xzmce_count-button\"><span>L</span></div></div></div></div></checker-extension></div><br><br></div><div><div class=\"div-img\">怎么用“温泉币”最快升满（2000钻大佬请转弯）？详见<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/158833.html\" target=\"_blank\">《温泉泡法推荐》</a><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">简单来说三步：1. </span>池子泡满、<span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">毛巾管够 2. 买通用的3爱心零食礼物，3. 买花之精和对应的</span><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/155442.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"display: inline !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">2爱心礼物</span></div></a></div><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/155442.html\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"div-img\"></div><